// A monorepo workspace index (D-WORKSPACE1=B, D-MONOREF1=A).
//
// `find("./packages")` discovers every subdirectory of `packages/` that carries
// its own `package.jet`, so adding a package is just adding a directory — no edit
// here. The `members:` expression is a full comptime expression: it may also
// reference a sibling `comptime` binding or call a top-level `fn` in this file.
//
// Once indexed, a member is addressable three ways from the CLI:
//   jetpack run repo.hello           # dot form  (source.package)
//   jetpack run packages/ranker      # path form (relative member path)
//   jetpack run ranker               # bare form (unique member name)
//
// A remote monorepo resolves index-first: only the addressed member's subtree
// (plus its in-repo dependencies) is sparsely fetched, never the whole repo.
module workspace {
    members: find("./packages")
}
